        "doc": "One TAXII timestamp as something comparable, or nothing.\n\nCompared as datetimes rather than as strings on purpose. TAXII timestamps\nvary in fractional precision, and `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z` sorts BEFORE\n`2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` as text because \".\" is below \"Z\" - which would move\na watermark backwards and silently re-read a collection every poll.",
